# Combadge's granted ability needs a Communicator attached to another creature. With the copy unattached, Llanowar Elves
# wearing the original attacks beside Grizzly Bears#1 wearing Basilisk Collar - an Equipment, but no Communicator - and
# Ornithopter blocks the Elves. Once the copy is on Grizzly Bears#2 (which stays home), the Elves attack and can't be
# blocked, while Grizzly Bears#1 beside them still can (CR 603.2, 613.1f, 509.1b, 301.5, 205.3g).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald x3
Llanowar Elves
Basilisk Collar
Combadge
Grizzly Bears x2
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Forest x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Basilisk Collar.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Combadge.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#3.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Combadge#1.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Basilisk Collar.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves; Grizzly Bears)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Llanowar Elves)
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 18
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Combadge#2.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
[Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves; Grizzly Bears#1)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Grizzly Bears#1)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears#2.Tapped = false
